01:16:00,000 --> 01:16:06,000
The Song of Names is a 2019 drama film directed by François Girard.

11
01:23:36,000 --> 01:23:42,000
An adaptation of the novel of the same name by Norman Lebrecht, it stars Tim Roth and Clive Owen
as childhood friends from London whose lives have been changed by World War II.

12
01:31:12,000 --> 01:31:18,000
The film was nominated for nine Canadian Screen Awards, winning five.

13
01:38:48,000 --> 01:38:54,000
The film explores themes of violin, holocaust (shoah),
world war ii, jewish life, child prodigy.

14
01:46:24,000 --> 01:46:30,000
The tone is emotional.
